# VIBRANT testing notes

## Purpose

This file records testing of VIBRANT as part of the phage prediction software comparison.

## Software

- Tool: VIBRANT
- Conda environment: `vibrant`

## Test 1 — reference FASTA input

### Input file

`australia_vibrio_phage_refs.fasta`

### Input type

FASTA file containing reference/assembled phage sequences, not raw FASTQ reads.

### Purpose

The purpose of this test was to check whether VIBRANT could be installed, set up, and run successfully on the same test FASTA file used for VirSorter2.

### Database setup issue

The first VIBRANT run failed because the required KEGG HMM database files were missing.

